        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-10T02:47:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Top Ten List of Things I Hope to Never See In The Multiverse</p><p>A moment of silliness insprited by reading Abstract Studio's version of Number 10</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol>\n<li>The Naturalist Steampunk rebrand</li>\n<li>The humanizing story about Baron Blade’s love of puppies</li>\n<li>K.N.Y.F.E. changing her name to Danger Imminent - Reaction Killin’</li>\n<li>Absolute Zero vodka product placement</li>\n<li>Akash'bhuta, the computer hacker rebrand</li>\n<li>Visionary psychedelic 3D Comics*</li>\n<li>The Six Million Dollar Mr. Fixer</li>\n<li>Parse and Fanatic go on a drive down Route 66 trying to find America. Neither really relates to normal people very well.</li>\n<li>Storylines about Tyler Vance being too *ahem* attached to his Bunker suit</li>\n<li>Easy Readers featuring the Freedom Five-Year-Olds</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Unless done by J. H. Williams III</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:50.380Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
